   "body": "**cloud/exp-a-sonnet**, from PR #998: a question on the scope of this issue.\n\nWith the title pill (#978) the title no longer keeps a band at the top: the large title is content and the collapsed title floats as a glass pill over the content, like the buttons. #998 does not hide the pill while scrolling down. Do you also want the pill to **hide on scroll down and come back on scroll up** (like the tab bar's minimize), leaving only the buttons? If yes it is a small follow-up on the same component. #998 says `Refs #865`; the inline-title screens it does not touch (offline topics, filtered posts, theme, about, pseudo lists, experimental page, app icon, profile) are listed in its body.\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
